<%- include('partials/legal-head') %>
      <p class="setup-eyebrow">Support</p>
      <h1 class="setup-title">Contact Influzer</h1>
      <p class="setup-lead">
        Email is the way to reach us. Write to
        <a href="mailto:hello@influzer.ai">hello@influzer.ai</a>
        for a listing, the Discovery MCP server, the newsletter, a privacy request, or a sponsored placement.
      </p>

      <section class="legal-block">
        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p>
          <a href="mailto:hello@influzer.ai">hello@influzer.ai</a>
        </p>
        <p>Include the page URL and, for a bug, what you clicked and what you expected to happen.</p>
        <p class="legal-actions">
          <a class="home-board__btn home-board__btn--primary" href="mailto:hello@influzer.ai">Email hello@influzer.ai</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="legal-grid">
        <section class="legal-block legal-card">
          <h2>MCP directory</h2>
          <p>Submit a missing server, or ask us to correct a listing you already published.</p>
          <p class="legal-actions">
            <a class="home-board__btn home-board__btn--ghost" href="/mcp/submit">Submit a server</a>
            <a class="home-board__btn home-board__btn--ghost" href="/mcp/my-listings">My listings</a>
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="legal-block legal-card">
          <h2>Discovery MCP</h2>
          <p>Connect the read-only catalog search at <code>https://www.influzer.ai/mcp/discovery</code>.</p>
          <p class="legal-actions">
            <a class="home-board__btn home-board__btn--ghost" href="/mcp/discovery/setup">Setup guide</a>
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="legal-block legal-card">
          <h2>Newsletter</h2>
          <p>Use the unsubscribe link in any issue. If that link fails, email us the address you subscribed with.</p>
          <p class="legal-actions">
            <a class="home-board__btn home-board__btn--ghost" href="mailto:hello@influzer.ai?subject=Newsletter">Email about the newsletter</a>
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="legal-block legal-card">
          <h2>Privacy</h2>
          <p>Ask for a copy or deletion of your account, comment, newsletter address, or a generated file.</p>
          <p class="legal-actions">
            <a class="home-board__btn home-board__btn--ghost" href="/privacy">Privacy policy</a>
            <a class="home-board__btn home-board__btn--ghost" href="mailto:hello@influzer.ai?subject=Privacy%20request">Privacy request</a>
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="legal-block legal-card">
          <h2>Sponsored placement</h2>
          <p>Questions about a labeled ad, a waitlist, or the advertising rules.</p>
          <p class="legal-actions">
            <a class="home-board__btn home-board__btn--ghost" href="/mcp/promote">Promote</a>
            <a class="home-board__btn home-board__btn--ghost" href="/mcp/promote/terms">Placement terms</a>
          </p>
        </section>
        <section class="legal-block legal-card">
          <h2>Account</h2>
          <p>Sign-in problems, a password reset that never arrived, or closing an account.</p>
          <p class="legal-actions">
            <a class="home-board__btn home-board__btn--ghost" href="/login">Log in</a>
            <a class="home-board__btn home-board__btn--ghost" href="mailto:hello@influzer.ai?subject=Account">Email about an account</a>
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
<%- include('partials/legal-foot') %>
